      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "text": "Trace three boundaries, not just one hostname: requested provider, address actually connected to, and redirect target. Map known providers to allowed destinations. Reject non-public IPv4 and IPv6 addresses for public-only access, and validate the resolved address used by the connection. Disable redirects or check each target. A permitted-looking hostname alone leaves the connected-address and redirect boundaries unverified.",
